                                            <p>Lakehawks, Today, we pause to honor the veterans who have answered our nation’s call to serve. Through their courage, sacrifice, and unwavering commitment, they have protected the freedoms we enjoy and safeguarded the ideals upon which our country was founded. Veterans Day is a reminder that the opportunities we pursue, the communities we build, and [&hellip;]</p>
