                                                25 Years Later: Remembering September 11th                                            </a>
                                        </h2>
                                        <div class="article-body">
                                            <p>Many members of our college community remember exactly where they were when they learned of the attacks. For others, particularly many of our students, September 11 is a moment they know only through history books, classrooms, and the stories shared by family members and teachers. As the years pass, it becomes even more important that we remember the events of that day and the lessons they continue to teach us.</p>
